OL,3,ABBC pauses civil service secondment
OL,4,Ascheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC says it will pause secondments
OL,7,Fof government statisticians to its fact
OL,8,Fchecking service, BBC Verify, and
OL,9,Freview their roles.
OL,11,FSince 2018 the BBC has offered
OL,12,Fsix-month secondment opportunities for
OL,13,Fup to two civil servant statisticians
OL,14,Fto work for BBC News's head of
OL,15,Fstatistics.
OL,17,FA BBC spokesperson said: "All BBC
OL,18,Fjournalism and editorial decisions are
OL,19,Fmade by BBC journalists and editors, in
OL,20,Fline with the BBC's editorial
OL,21,Fguidelines, so the statisticians never
OL,22,Fmake editorial decisions."
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
