OL,3,ABBC pauses civil service secondment
OL,4,Ascheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose currently on secondment would not
OL,7,Fbe involved in the publication of news
OL,8,For content during the review and the
OL,9,Fcurrent round of recruitment will be
OL,10,Fpaused while the role is reviewed, the
OL,11,Fcorporation added.
